<p>Washington's kitchen market is led by the Puget Sound region — Seattle, Bellevue, and the Eastside tech corridor — with a strong remodel culture and high-end demand on Mercer Island and the waterfront. This guide covers the brands available and where to see them.</p>
<h2 id="find-a-kitchen-cabinet-showroom-near-you">Find a Kitchen Cabinet Showroom Near You</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales brands are sold through independent local showrooms across Washington. Tell us your project and where you're located, and we'll connect you with the nearest authorized dealer.</p>
<p><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact">Find a Local Dealer</a></p>
<h2 id="premium-cabinetry-brands-available-in-washington">Premium Cabinetry Brands Available in Washington</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and wide wood species for Washington's transitional and PNW-modern kitchens.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access modern construction — a strong fit for clean contemporary Seattle and Eastside design.</li>
