<h2 id="washington-kitchen-design-trends">Washington Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>Washington kitchens lean Pacific-Northwest contemporary: natural wood tones, warm neutrals, matte finishes, and clean lines that suit the region's modern and craftsman-influenced homes. Seattle's remodel market favors transitional-to-modern work with two-tone schemes and warm-wood islands, while the affluent Eastside — Bellevue, Kirkland, Mercer Island, backed by the tech economy — drives demand for sleek <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens.</p>
